      "message": "mining: handle negative and NaN waitTipChanged timeouts\n\nThe timeout passed to waitTipChanged can come from an IPC client,\nso it should not be checked with Assume. A negative value aborted\ndebug builds, and NaN passed both clamps and reached wait_until.\n\nTreat negative and NaN timeouts as zero and add functional test\ncoverage for waitTipChanged and waitNext",
